<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>灯塔 on Phallaina · 星吟</title><link>https://phallaina.github.io/tags/%E7%81%AF%E5%A1%94/</link><description>Recent content in 灯塔 on Phallaina · 星吟</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://phallaina.github.io/tags/%E7%81%AF%E5%A1%94/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>灯塔与鲸</title><link>https://phallaina.github.io/posts/2026-09-30-lighthouse-whale/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://phallaina.github.io/posts/2026-09-30-lighthouse-whale/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;灯塔和鲸，似乎总是隔着一段距离。灯塔亮着，守在礁石与风暴之间；鲸游着，穿过漫无边际的深水。它们互不相识，却总在某个瞬间，隔着整片海遥遥相望。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>